/S /H1
/P 90 0 R
/T (As a responsible organization, we have continued to support these communities in making informed decisions about their lives. This is achieved through specialized training programs, workshops on evolving social and economic scenarios, and by bridging the gap between the people and essential government schemes and entitlements.  )
/E (As a responsible organization, we have continued to support these communities in making informed decisions about their lives. This is achieved through specialized training programs, workshops on evolving social and economic scenarios, and by bridging the gap between the people and essential government schemes and entitlements.  )
