/S /P
/P 95 0 R
/E (LOK SWAR has remained dedicated to empowering female across age groups in Jharkhand. Through strategic partnerships with donors like the British Asian Trust, Connect HeR, British Asian Trust and self supported programs we have addressed critical intersections of safe migration, gender justice and local governance. For the empowerment of females from various age groups, LOK SWAR has been dedicatedly working across districts in Jharkhand state.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
