1153 0 obj
<<
/Title (Since its foundation in 2000, Lok Swar has remained steadfast in its commitment to the development of society's most vulnerable and marginalized groups. Our core philosophy centers on enhancing the socio-economic standing of these communities by providing them with a robust ecosystem to flourish. We believe that sustainable development must be built for and with people, where our role as a grassroots NGO is to act as a facilitator and enabler. Our goal is to empower individuals with the necessary skills to lead a dignified life by effectively managing and profiting from the livelihood opportunities around them.)
