/Title (Workshop Brief:  The 1-Day Workshop on Scientific Kitchen Gardening Techniques is a practical, hands-on capacity-building initiative designed to promote household nutrition, climate resilience, and economic self-reliance through sustainable micro-farming. In many rural and peri-urban communities, families spend a significant portion of their income purchasing vegetables, often consuming produce grown with chemical pesticides or lacking essential micronutrients.)
