/Title (LOK SWAR, formed in 2000 by female activists from Dhurwa, had its roots in a prior informal association dedicated to social development, especially women's issues. Officially registered under the Indian Trusts Act 1882, it has since focused on uplifting vulnerable and marginalized communities & section of the society. Its inaugural governing body meeting occurred in 1999, marking its foundational moment. Prior to its establishment, the founders had been involved in various social causes for over a decade. Their collective aim was to create a society devoid of caste, class, exploitation, and injustice, striving to meet everyone's basic needs with dignity.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1304 0 R
